---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/safeguarding.html
title: Safeguarding
subtitle: The care of children and vulnerable adults is everyone's responsibility — and we take it very seriously at Emmanuel.
intro_content: >- 
  Our PCC Safeguarding Policy Statement

callout:
  - heading: Everyone is responsible.
    body: If something doesn't feel right, please speak up. Our Parish Safeguarding Officer is here
      to listen and to help.
    primary_button:
      - label: Email Sarah Watts
        href: mailto:safeguarding@emmanuelnw6.com
    secondary_button:
      - label: Contact the clergy
        href: mailto:vicar@emmanuelnw6.com
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>Safeguarding — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <section class="em-pagehead em-pagehead--band em-pagehead--plain">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Safeguarding</span></div>
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="deck">{{ subtitle }}</p>

    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <div data-editable="text" data-prop="intro_content" data-type="html">
          {% for para in intro_content.split("\n\n") %}<p>{{ para | trim | safe }}</p>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p>What happens if I put text here?</p>

<p><strong>Our Church is Committed to:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Promoting a safer environment and culture.</li>
<li>Safely recruiting and supporting all those with any responsibility related to children, young people and vulnerable adults within the church.</li>
<li>Responding promptly to every safeguarding concern or allegation.</li>
<li>Caring pastorally for victims/survivors of abuse and other affected persons.</li>
<li>Caring pastorally for those who are the subject of concerns or allegations of abuse and other affected persons.</li>
<li>Responding to those that may pose a present risk to others.</li>
</ul>

        
      </div>      
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4>Parish Safeguarding Officer</h4>
          <p class="big" style="font-size:24px">Sarah Watts</p>
          <p>For any safeguarding concern or question, Sarah can be reached directly by email.</p>
          <a href="mailto:safeguarding@emmanuelnw6.com" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-top:4px">safeguarding@emmanuelnw6.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="em-aside-card" style="margin-top:24px">
          <h4>Office hours</h4>
          <p>Monday–Wednesday &amp; Friday 9am–2pm.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px">The Safeguarding email address is checked regularly. However, if you have an urgent pastoral or safeguarding concern please call the vicar: <a href="tel:+447729951935">07729 951 935</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <p>Our statutory <a href="/assets/cms/safeguarding/Emmanuel-Church-Safeguarding-Policy-2025-26-Sarah-Claire (1).pdf">Parish Safeguarding Policy</a?</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="em-section em-section--band">
    <div class="inner inner--narrow">
      <div class="em-sectionhead" style="margin-bottom:32px">
        <div class="em-ornament is-leading">In an emergency</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:32px">If someone is in immediate danger</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="em-body">
        <p>If a child or adult is in immediate danger, always call the emergency services on <strong>999</strong>. You can also contact the Diocese of London safeguarding team, or the NSPCC and other national helplines, for confidential advice at any time.</p>
        <div class="em-placeholder" style="margin-top:8px"><p>Diocesan safeguarding contact details and national helpline numbers to be confirmed with the Parish Safeguarding Officer.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% for c in callout %}
  <section class="em-callout">
    <div class="inner">
      <div><h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="heading" data-type="span">{{ c.heading }}</h3><p data-editable="text" data-prop="body" data-type="text">{{ c.body }}</p></div>
      {% if (c.primary_button and c.primary_button.length) or (c.secondary_button and c.secondary_button.length) %}
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        {% for btn in c.primary_button %}<a href="{{ btn.href }}" class="em-btn em-btn--tan">{{ btn.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
        {% for btn in c.secondary_button %}<a href="{{ btn.href }}" class="em-btn em-btn--ghost-light">{{ btn.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
